The eligibility criteria mention prior immunotherapy failure in several trials. 

• NCT05607563 EXCLUDES patients who have grade ≥3 immune-mediated adverse event that associated with a prior immunotherapy;
• NCT03881488 EXCLUDES prior treatment with other investigational immune-oncology therapies, which implies previous immunotherapy failure;
• NCT03742258 EXCLUDES patients with exposure to chemotherapy or immunotherapy =< 30 days prior to starting study treatment, which includes those who failed prior immunotherapy;
• NCT07481721 EXCLUDES prior treatment with immune checkpoint inhibitors or other immunotherapies, indicating previous immunotherapy failure;
• NCT07221942 EXCLUDES patients who received prior immunotherapy for mUC or for an alternative malignancy unless they developed an immune related adverse event while on therapy requiring cessation of therapy or use of disease modifying agents, corticosteroids, or immunosuppressive drugs.
